ols-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-overview-mismatch","content":"The Overview says Human-Reviewed, but the Tools tab says Auto Run. Which is right?"},"41":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Related"},"42":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","content":"A tool is one action an agent is allowed to take, such as looking up a record, drafting an email or posting to a channel. Every agent in the Oliv AI agent marketplace with a detail page lists its tools on a **Tools** tab. Each tool carries a run mode that decides how much freedom the agent has with it: **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval** or **Agent Decides**."},"43":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                        |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| **What a tool is** | One action an agent is allowed to take |","table":"table-0"},"44":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                 |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Where tools live** | **Agents › [agent] › Tools**, on every agent with a detail page |","table":"table-0"},"45":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|               |                                                        |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Run modes** | **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval**, **Agent Decides** |","table":"table-0"},"46":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                 |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Default mode** | **Auto Run**, for any tool that doesn't store a mode of its own |","table":"table-0"},"47":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|             |                                 |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| **Set for** | One tool on one agent at a time |","table":"table-0"},"48":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Tool catalog** | Salesforce, HubSpot, Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack |","table":"table-0"},"49":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Conversation setting** | **Ask before acting** or **Act without asking**, on Oliv AI's Olivia and Oliver agents |","table":"table-0"},"50":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"Tools are what turn an agent from something that reads into something that acts. Each tool has a name, an icon and a one-sentence summary of what it does, and the agents described in the product hold between 3 and 8 tools each. The actions cover reading records, creating and updating them, logging calls, meetings and emails, sending and drafting email, managing calendar events and posting to channels."},"51":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"The run mode is the second half. It sits on each tool card as a dropdown, and it applies to that one tool on that one agent. Changing it on one tool changes nothing else."},"52":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"| Run mode     | Icon                            | What the agent does with the tool |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Auto Run** | A filled lightning mark, indigo | Acts without asking               |","table":"table-1"},"53":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"| Run mode              | Icon                   | What the agent does with the tool   |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| **Requires Approval** | A warning circle, rose | Waits for a person to confirm first |","table":"table-1"},"54":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-it-is","content":"| Run mode          | Icon                  | What the agent does with the tool |\n| ----------------- | --------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| **Agent Decides** | A question mark, gray | Judges whether to ask             |","table":"table-1"},"55":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"The tool catalog groups actions by the system they come from. These are the same apps Oliv AI works alongside, from your CRM to your inbox."},"56":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System         | Tools offered   | What they cover                                                                                                  |\n| -------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Salesforce** | 34, in 6 groups | **Lookup / Search**, **Create / Update**, **Associations**, **Activities**, **Pipeline / Forecast**, **Utility** |","table":"table-2"},"57":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System      | Tools offered   | What they cover                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Hubspot** | 31, in 6 groups | **Lookup / Search**, **Create / Update**, **Associations**, **Activities**, **Marketing**, **Utility** |","table":"table-2"},"58":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System    | Tools offered | What they cover                                                           |\n| --------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Gmail** | 9             | Send, retrieve, search, reply, draft, attach, label, read threads, delete |","table":"table-2"},"59":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System              | Tools offered | What they cover                                                                |\n| ------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Google Calendar** | 9             | Create, list, update and cancel events, read calendar details, find free slots |","table":"table-2"},"60":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System      | Tools offered | What they cover                                                                        |\n| ----------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Outlook** | 9             | Send, retrieve, search, reply, draft, attach, read calendar events, categorize, delete |","table":"table-2"},"61":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System       | Tools offered | What they cover                                                          |\n| ------------ | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **LinkedIn** | 9             | Read public profile, company and post information, and comment on a post |","table":"table-2"},"62":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-sources","content":"| System    | Tools offered | What they cover                                                              |\n| --------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Slack** | 5             | Send a message, read messages, create a channel, invite users, upload a file |","table":"table-2"},"63":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#what-its-for","content":"Tools decide what an agent may do in your systems, and run modes decide how freely it does it. Together they're where you read and set an agent's permission to act. You make that call one action at a time, not once for the whole agent."},"64":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Every action sits in one list.** Each card names the action and says in a sentence what it does, so nothing an agent can do is hidden."},"65":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Risk is set where it lives.** A record lookup and a stage update on the same agent can run under different modes."},"66":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Writes can wait for a person.** **Requires Approval** holds an action until someone confirms it."},"67":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#how-it-helps","content":"**Routine reads stay quick.** **Auto Run** lets low-risk actions happen without a prompt."},"68":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#without-it","content":"Without a per-action setting, an agent's freedom is all or nothing. Either it writes to your CRM, mailbox and channels unchecked, or it only reads and every update still falls to a person. The first puts the records your forecast depends on at risk. The second loses most of the time the agent was meant to save."},"69":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#why-buyers-care","content":"This matters most to the people who own the systems agents write to: revenue operations teams and CRM admins. It matters at rollout, when a team first lets an agent change records or send mail. It matters again each time an agent gains a new tool, because a tool that stores no mode starts on **Auto Run**."},"70":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"Picture a revenue operations lead getting ready to switch on an agent for a sales team of 40. The agent can look up Salesforce opportunities, log calls and change fields such as stage and close date. Lookups worry nobody. A wrong stage change, though, lands straight in Monday's forecast call."},"71":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"The common answer is a single switch for the whole agent. Teams often keep it read-only for weeks and paste its suggestions into the CRM by hand. That probably feels safe. It also means the agent saves little time, and the pile of suggestions grows with every rep added."},"72":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"The risk isn't spread evenly across the agent. It sits in the handful of actions that write to shared records or reach customers. Reading a record can't break anything, so it makes sense to hold back only the actions that can."},"73":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"Oliv AI puts the control on each tool instead of on the agent. Every card on an agent's **Tools** tab carries its own run mode. The RevOps lead leaves lookups on **Auto Run** and sets stage and close date updates to **Requires Approval**. Call logging goes on **Agent Decides** while the team watches how the agent behaves."},"74":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#approach","content":"You can see the setting on the tab itself. The three modes always appear in the same order, and each keeps one icon and color on the button and in the menu. How other platforms handle an agent's freedom to act is covered in How agent tools and run modes compare, below."},"75":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"There are three ways in:"},"76":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"From the agent's detail page, select the **Tools** tab."},"77":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"On the **Overview** tab, press one of the agent's tool pills."},"78":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"On the **Instructions** tab, press a tool chip inside a process step. The **Tools** tab opens with that tool scrolled into view."},"79":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#open-tools","content":"The tab has two columns. A sidebar down the left holds **Add Tool** above the list of the agent's tools. The main pane on the right shows the same tools as cards, in the same order. Press a tool's name in the sidebar and its card scrolls into view."},"80":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Open the agent and select **Tools**."},"81":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Find the tool. Scroll the main pane, or press the tool's name in the sidebar."},"82":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Read the card: the tool's name as a heading, with a sentence beneath saying what it does."},"83":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Press the dropdown at the right of the card. It shows the tool's current mode with its icon."},"84":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Choose **Auto Run**, **Requires Approval** or **Agent Decides**. The menu closes and the button shows the new mode."},"85":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#set-run-mode","content":"Repeat for each tool you want to change. To close the menu without changing anything, press anywhere outside it."},"86":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"| Mode         | A good fit for                                                                         |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Auto Run** | Actions that only read, such as searching records or reading a public LinkedIn profile |","table":"table-3"},"87":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"| Mode                  | A good fit for                                                                                             |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Requires Approval** | Actions that change shared records or reach customers, such as updating an opportunity or sending an email |","table":"table-3"},"88":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"| Mode              | A good fit for                                                             |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Agent Decides** | Actions where you're happy for the agent to judge when a check is worth it |","table":"table-3"},"89":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#choosing-a-mode","content":"If you're weighing how much an AI agent should do alone, start writes on **Requires Approval** and widen them once you trust the output."},"90":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Press **Add Tool** at the top of the sidebar to open the catalog, a panel headed **Add Tool**. It shows the actions an agent could be given, grouped by the system they come from."},"91":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Pick a system in the list on the left. **Salesforce** is selected when the panel opens."},"92":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Read the main pane. It lists that system's tools under category headings, such as **Lookup / Search** or **Create / Update** for a CRM, and **Actions** for Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack."},"93":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Read each card: the tool's name, with a one-line description beneath."},"94":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"Close the panel with the **×** at the top right, or press the dimmed page behind it."},"95":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#tool-catalog","content":"The catalog is the same whichever agent you opened it from. It doesn't reflect the tools that agent already has."},"96":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-overview","content":"The **Overview** tab lists an agent's tools as pills. Some agents split them under two headings, **Tools (Auto-Run)** and **Tools (Human-Reviewed)**. Those headings come from lists stored separately from the dropdowns, so the two can disagree. Treat the **Tools** tab as the control."},"97":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-instructions","content":"The process steps on the **Instructions** tab name the tools each step uses. Pressing a tool chip there takes you to that tool's card, which is the quickest way to check the mode of a tool a step depends on."},"98":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-super-agents","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent and Oliv AI's Oliver agent carry their own autonomy setting beneath the message box: **Ask before acting** or **Act without asking**. It covers a whole conversation, opens on **Ask before acting**, and is separate from any tool's run mode. Choosing **Act without asking** for Oliver shows a **High Risk** warning above the message box."},"99":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#with-run-records","content":"An agent's run records show both outcomes of a run mode: emails sent automatically, and emails drafted and left for a person to send. That's where you see how an agent that acts differs from a copilot that suggests."},"100":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#who-uses-it","content":"These are typical patterns, shown to illustrate how the settings are used."},"101":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#revenue-operations","content":"Before a rollout, a revops team walks each agent's **Tools** tab and lists every tool that writes to Salesforce or HubSpot. Those go to **Requires Approval** first. Read-only lookups stay on **Auto Run**, so the CRM work agents take on starts with a person checking each write."},"102":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#sales-development","content":"A sales development team lets an agent read public LinkedIn profiles and company posts on **Auto Run**. Sending email from Gmail or Outlook stays on **Requires Approval**, so no first touch reaches a prospect unseen. That keeps AI outreach from burning through the target list."},"103":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#customer-success","content":"A customer success team lets an agent post account updates to an internal Slack channel on **Auto Run**. Anything addressed to the customer, such as a reply in Gmail, waits on **Requires Approval**."},"104":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#enablement","content":"An enablement lead uses the one-line summaries on each tool card to brief new reps on what each agent may do in their accounts. The colored icons make it easy to point out which actions run unattended and which wait for a person."},"105":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"Oliv AI sets an agent's freedom to act on each tool, with a choice of three modes. One of them lets the agent itself judge whether a check is needed. Its tools act in the systems revenue teams work in, from CRM records to email, calendars and Slack. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"106":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"Agent permissions, from each platform's public documentation:"},"107":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform    | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                   | Yes                      | Yes                             |","table":"table-4"},"108":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Not in docs                           | Not in docs              | Outputs stay inside Gong        |","table":"table-4"},"109":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform     | Approval choice for each agent action      | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps    |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Partly (fixed check before record changes) | Not in docs              | Partly (read-only connector tools) |","table":"table-4"},"110":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform         | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies.ai** | Partly (allow or block per app)       | Not in docs              | Yes (custom connectors)         |","table":"table-4"},"111":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"| Platform  | Approval choice for each agent action | Agent judges when to ask | Agent actions in connected apps |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Not in docs                           | Not in docs              | Not in docs                     |","table":"table-4"},"112":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"113":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**Approval set per action.** Oliv AI gives each tool its own run mode, so lookups and writes on one agent can differ. Outreach's Omni pauses for confirmation before any change to a Prospect, Account or Opportunity record."},"114":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**Agents that act beyond their own app.** Oliv AI's tools update CRM records, send email and post to Slack. Gong's help center says its agents generate outputs within Gong Assistant and do not perform actions in external systems. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"115":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**Writes as well as reads.** Oliv AI's catalog includes **Create / Update** tools for Salesforce and HubSpot. Outreach's help center says only read-only tools are supported over its connectors at this time."},"116":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"**A middle setting between asking and acting.** With **Agent Decides**, the agent judges whether to ask before it uses a tool. Fireflies.ai documents choosing which permissions AskFred has in each connected app."},"117":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"118":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**One tool at a time.** There's no bulk control, and no agent-wide or workspace-wide default mode."},"119":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Auto Run is the default.** A tool that stores no mode shows **Auto Run**, and moving a tool to **Auto Run** asks for no confirmation. Check new tools before an agent goes live."},"120":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**No role check.** Anyone who can reach an agent's **Tools** tab can change a tool's mode."},"121":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Tools can't be removed or reordered.** There's no delete control on a tool card or in the sidebar."},"122":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Add Tool is grayed out on some agents.** On the full-height tools layout used by the richer agent pages, the button is disabled, with no message saying why."},"123":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Tools have no settings of their own.** There are no parameters, field mappings or filters, so you can't limit a tool to certain records or fields."},"124":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**No connection status.** The tab doesn't show whether a tool's system is connected."},"125":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Agent Decides isn't explained in the product.** The menu offers it without saying what the agent weighs."},"126":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#limits","content":"**Two labels for one idea.** The dropdown says **Requires Approval**; the **Overview** heading says **Human-Reviewed**."},"127":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-what-is-a-tool","content":"A tool is one action an agent is allowed to take, such as finding a record, drafting an email or posting to a channel. Each one is listed on the agent's **Tools** tab with a one-line summary."},"128":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-default-mode","content":"**Auto Run**, unless the tool stores a different mode. That means the agent acts without asking, so set writes to **Requires Approval** if you want a person to check them."},"129":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-approval-vs-decides","content":"With **Requires Approval**, a person confirms before the agent uses the tool. With **Agent Decides**, the agent judges for itself whether to ask first."},"130":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-bulk","content":"No. Each tool is set on its own card, one at a time. There's no agent-wide or workspace-wide default."},"131":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-systems","content":"Seven: Salesforce and HubSpot, plus Gmail, Google Calendar, Outlook, LinkedIn and Slack. Salesforce offers 34 tools and HubSpot 31; Slack offers 5 and the others 9 each."},"132":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-add-tool-disabled","content":"Agents on the full-height tools layout have **Add Tool** disabled. The button looks faded and shows a not-allowed cursor."},"133":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-remove","content":"No. There's no delete control on the tool card or in the sidebar."},"134":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-ask-before-acting","content":"No. **Ask before acting** covers a whole conversation with Oliv AI's Olivia or Oliver agent. **Requires Approval** covers one tool on one agent, and the two are set separately."},"135":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-who-can-change","content":"Anyone who can reach the agent's **Tools** tab. No role check guards the control, so plan who has access before a rollout."},"136":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-limit-records","content":"No. Tools carry no parameters, field mappings or filters."},"137":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#faq-overview-mismatch","content":"Treat the **Tools** tab as the control. The **Overview** headings come from a separately stored list and can disagree with the dropdowns."},"138":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-136","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Prepare for a meeting: how agents send a brief before your calls."},"139":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-137","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every guide, by agent and feature."},"140":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-138","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Browse agents in the marketplace: the agents whose tools this page describes."},"141":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-139","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent: the agent that writes field updates back to your CRM."},"142":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-140","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"How the agents are built: the platform layer each agent's tools run on."},"143":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-141","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"AI agents for RevOps: where agents fit in a revenue operations team."},"144":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-142","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Salesforce automation explained: how agent actions compare with flows and rules."},"145":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-143","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Agentic sales automation: what changes when software acts, not just suggests."},"146":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes-144","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/builder/tools-and-run-modes#related","content":"Connected apps: the systems Oliv AI connects to."},"147":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"page","content":"Deal Driver agent","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Agents"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver"},"148":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-0","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","content":"What Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent sends sales managers each day and week, which deal risks trigger an alert, how to set it up, and how it compares with other pipeline tools."},"149":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-1","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"150":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-2","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-it-is","content":"What the Deal Driver agent is"},"151":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-3","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"The daily rhythm"},"152":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-4","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"The weekly rhythm"},"153":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-5","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#why-it-matters","content":"Why the Deal Driver agent matters"},"154":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-6","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"155":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-7","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"156":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-8","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"157":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-9","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#why-buyers-care","content":"Why buyers care"},"158":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-10","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"The Oliv AI approach to the Deal Driver agent"},"159":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-11","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"Set up Deal Driver"},"160":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-12","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"Deal risk alerts and next steps"},"161":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-13","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#rep-nudges","content":"Nudges for reps"},"162":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-14","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#meeting-support","content":"Meeting support for reps"},"163":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-15","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#works-with","content":"How Deal Driver works with other agents"},"164":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-16","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-coach","content":"Coach"},"165":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-17","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-forecaster","content":"Forecaster"},"166":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-18","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-crm-manager","content":"CRM Manager"},"167":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-19","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-portfolio-manager","content":"Portfolio Manager"},"168":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-20","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-olivia","content":"Olivia"},"169":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-21","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#who-uses-it","content":"Who uses Deal Driver, and how"},"170":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-22","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#sales-managers","content":"Sales managers"},"171":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-23","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#bdr-leads","content":"BDR leads"},"172":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-24","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#sales-leadership","content":"VPs of Sales and regional heads"},"173":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-25","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#revops","content":"Revenue operations"},"174":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-26","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"How the Deal Driver agent compares"},"175":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-27","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for the Deal Driver agent"},"176":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-28","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"177":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-29","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"178":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-30","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-standup","content":"Will Deal Driver replace my daily standup?"},"179":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-31","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-alert-triggers","content":"Can I customize what triggers an alert?"},"180":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-32","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-bdr-teams","content":"Does it work for BDR teams?"},"181":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-33","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-thursday-report","content":"How does the Thursday 1:1 report work?"},"182":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-34","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-existing-tools","content":"We already have a pipeline visibility tool. Do we still need Deal Driver?"},"183":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-35","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-meeting-assistant","content":"Do I need Meeting Assistant separately?"},"184":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-36","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-crm-writes","content":"Does Deal Driver write to the CRM?"},"185":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-37","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-cs-managers","content":"Does it work for customer success managers?"},"186":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-38","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-setup-time","content":"How long does setup take?"},"187":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-39","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-reps","content":"Do reps need to change how they work?"},"188":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-40","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#related","content":"Related"},"189":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-41","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent keeps sales managers ahead of their team's pipeline without daily standups, manual rep check-ins or digging through CRM reports. It sends a morning brief, fires alerts when something important happens during the day, and closes the day with a summary. Each week it also prepares per-rep 1:1 reports and a rollup for leadership."},"190":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-42","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                     |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Watches the team's pipeline and tells managers what needs attention |","table":"table-0"},"191":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-43","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                 |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Sales managers, BDR leads and regional heads of sales, plus VP Sales and RevOps |","table":"table-0"},"192":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                       |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Daily rhythm** | Morning brief, event-triggered alerts, sunset summary |","table":"table-0"},"193":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                   |                                                                      |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Weekly rhythm** | Per-rep 1:1 reports on Thursday, team pipeline review, Monday rollup |","table":"table-0"},"194":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|                          |                                    |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Where it reaches you** | Slack, email, or the Oliv platform |","table":"table-0"},"195":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#at-a-glance","content":"|              |                                           |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| **Includes** | The Meeting Assistant capability for reps |","table":"table-0"},"196":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent is a manager intelligence agent. Managers stay informed at every level, from an individual rep to a single deal to the full team, from one agent. It doesn't write to the CRM. It surfaces signals for the manager to act on."},"197":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-it-is","content":"Deal Driver is also a bundle. It includes the capabilities of Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent: pre-call prep, post-call follow-up and CRM sync for reps. If you're on Deal Driver, your reps already have Meeting Assistant."},"198":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"**Morning brief.** Today's meetings across the team, flags for meetings where the manager's attendance or notes would help, and priority deals to watch, based on the prior 24 hours."},"199":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"**Event-triggered alerts.** A signal during the day when a deal stalls, a stage drifts or a high-value opportunity goes quiet."},"200":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#daily-rhythm","content":"**Sunset summary.** Deals won or lost that day, meetings that happened and their key outcomes, deals newly flagged at risk, and open situations to follow up."},"201":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"**Per-rep 1:1 reports.** Each rep's pipeline, activity, deal health and flagged items, delivered every Thursday before the manager's first meeting of the day."},"202":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"**Team pipeline review.** A rolled-up view of the team's pipeline health, coverage and risk profile, ready for leadership reviews."},"203":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#weekly-rhythm","content":"**Monday rollup.** A ready-to-review pipeline summary for leadership, prepared before the first standup."},"204":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent is for managers who need to know what is happening in their team's pipeline without asking for it. It removes the lag between what happens in the field and what the manager hears."},"205":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**The day starts briefed.** Meetings, risks and deals that need attention first are surfaced before the day starts."},"206":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**Risk shows up early.** Alerts fire the moment deals stall or stages drift, not when a rep escalates."},"207":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**1:1s start at strategy.** Rep reviews arrive prepped, so the meeting skips twenty minutes of status updates."},"208":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#how-it-helps","content":"**Reps get time back.** A follow-up is drafted in about five minutes for the rep to review and send."},"209":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#without-it","content":"A deal can go quiet with no activity, no CRM flag and no alert. A week later, the rep says \"it's progressing\" at the standup. By day fourteen the deal is cold and the rep escalates, after two or more weeks of invisible risk."},"210":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#why-buyers-care","content":"Deal Driver is bought by sales managers, VPs of Sales and regional heads. The sales manager is the main daily beneficiary, because the agent turns time spent on admin into time spent coaching."},"211":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"Think of a regional sales leader with eight account executives and about forty open opportunities. Every Monday she walks the VP of Sales through the region's pipeline. On Friday she starts working out which of those forty deals are really moving."},"212":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"The usual method is a CRM export, a message to each rep asking for an update, and a skim of recent call notes. It can easily take an evening. Even then, the picture is only as current as the last field each rep remembered to fill in."},"213":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"The raw signals already exist as the team works. Meetings get held, next steps get set, close dates slip and fields stay blank. What's missing is something that reads those signals every day and rolls them up on a schedule."},"214":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"Oliv AI handles this with its Deal Driver agent. It monitors all activity on the team's deals and alerts the leader when a deal enters a risk state. Each alert carries the signal, the context and a suggested action. Before the first Monday standup, the leadership rollup is already prepared."},"215":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#approach","content":"Managers choose what counts as risk. Inactivity windows, field completion requirements and deal value thresholds can all be set per manager or per team, as listed in the set-up steps. How that rhythm lines up against other pipeline tools is covered in How the Deal Driver agent compares, below."},"216":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** Deal Driver reads Deal Insights data: stage, amount, close date and next steps."},"217":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Connect your team's calendar.** Meeting and activity data from Oliv feed the morning brief and the alerts."},"218":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Confirm the team roster and manager hierarchy.** Deal Driver needs both to know whose deals roll up to whom."},"219":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Set your alert thresholds.** Choose inactivity windows, field completion requirements and deal value thresholds, per manager or per team."},"220":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"**Adjust the brief format if you want to.** Managers can customize alert sensitivity and brief format."},"221":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#set-up","content":"Most managers are live within a week. Reps don't need to change anything. Deal Driver works in the background and shows up for them as follow-up prompts and next-step reminders."},"222":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"Deal Driver monitors all activity and triggers an alert when:"},"223":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A deal enters a risk state, such as no activity for a set number of days or a close date approaching without progress."},"224":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A rep hasn't updated the Core 4 Fields after a meeting."},"225":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A deal stage changes unexpectedly, moving backward or stalling mid-stage."},"226":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A high-value opportunity goes quiet."},"227":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"A rep shows a pattern that warrants attention, such as consistently missing next-step fields."},"228":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#deal-risk","content":"Each alert includes the deal, the signal, the relevant context and a suggested action for the manager."},"229":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#rep-nudges","content":"Deal Driver also nudges reps directly when deals stall, next steps go overdue or activity drops. That catches the gap before a manager needs to step in."},"230":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#meeting-support","content":"The Deal Driver bundle includes meeting-level support for individual reps."},"231":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#meeting-support","content":"**Before the meeting.** About 30 minutes before every meeting on an active opportunity, the rep gets a deal summary, qualification status against the methodology, stakeholder context and a recommended agenda. MEDDPICC, BANT or a custom framework all work."},"232":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#meeting-support","content":"**After the meeting.** Once the recording is processed, the follow-up email is drafted, CRM field updates are proposed and qualification gaps are flagged, all within five minutes of the call ending."},"233":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-coach","content":"Oliv AI's Coach agent is the rep development layer. Both run in the same Thursday-morning window: the 1:1 report lands first with pipeline status, and Coach follows minutes later with that rep's coaching goal and weekly progress."},"234":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-forecaster","content":"Oliv AI's Forecaster agent builds on Deal Driver's signals. Deal Driver flags the exceptions, such as close dates without activity, and Forecaster rolls those signals into the number."},"235":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-crm-manager","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent refreshes deal fields overnight from calls, emails and meetings. It also supplies the Core 4 Fields completion data that triggers gap alerts."},"236":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-portfolio-manager","content":"Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent is the customer success equivalent. It applies the same manager-visibility model to the renewal and retention book."},"237":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#with-olivia","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the front-facing master agent for reps. Deal Driver is the manager's tool, though the Meeting Assistant capability inside the bundle serves reps directly."},"238":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#sales-managers","content":"A sales manager gets the morning brief before the standup and the 1:1 reports every Thursday. Many shorten the daily standup, and some drop it. More on Oliv AI for sales managers and a day in a sales manager's workflow."},"239":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#bdr-leads","content":"BDR leads use Deal Driver the same way as sales managers. The morning brief, rep activity alerts and 1:1 reports work across BDR and AE pipelines, with different cadence and field settings. See how Oliv AI supports sales development teams."},"240":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#sales-leadership","content":"Leaders get the team pipeline review and the Monday rollup, ready before the first standup of the week. Read how a VP of Sales can stop deals slipping unseen."},"241":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#revops","content":"RevOps sets the alert thresholds and keeps the CRM data behind them accurate. More on how Oliv AI works for revenue operations."},"242":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"Most pipeline tools give managers somewhere to look. Deal Driver tells them when to look, sends a 1:1 report for every rep each week, and wraps each day in a sunset summary. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"243":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"Pipeline management features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"244":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform    | Deal risk alerts | Per-rep 1:1 report each week | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| ----------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes              | Yes                          | Yes                                |","table":"table-1"},"245":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"| Platform | Deal risk alerts               | Per-rep 1:1 report each week             | End-of-day summary for the manager |\n| -------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI Deal Monitor warnings) | Partly (deal board to check before 1:1s) | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"246":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-drive