------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Partly (answers on deal risks) | Not in docs                  | Not in docs                        |","table":"table-1"},"250":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"251":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"**The 1:1 report comes to you.** Deal Driver compiles each rep's pipeline every Thursday and puts it in the manager's inbox. Gong recommends checking a deal board weekly, particularly before 1:1s and pipeline reviews. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"252":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"**An alert with a next move.** Each Deal Driver alert carries the deal, the signal, the context and a suggested action. Avoma's Deal Health produces a 0 to 100 risk score with a Low, Medium or High classification. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"253":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"**A daily rhythm, not a weekly check.** Deal Driver sends a morning brief and a sunset summary every day. Gong's pipeline generation dashboard recipe says it should be viewed weekly. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"254":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"255":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It doesn't update CRM fields.** Deal Driver surfaces data quality gaps. CRM Manager makes the updates."},"256":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It isn't the forecast.** Forecaster handles pipeline projection and accuracy. Deal Driver handles real-time visibility and alerts."},"257":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It isn't a coaching tool.** Coach handles rep development."},"258":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**It's built for sales teams.** Customer success managers use Portfolio Manager instead."},"259":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#limits","content":"**Signals depend on the data.** Deal Driver's signals are only as good as the data behind them, which is why CRM Manager matters."},"260":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-standup","content":"For many managers, yes. When reps get their own activity alerts and you have a morning brief, the standup becomes a strategy conversation. Some managers drop it."},"261":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-alert-triggers","content":"Yes. Inactivity windows, field completion requirements and deal value thresholds are all configurable per manager or per team."},"262":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-bdr-teams","content":"Yes. Sales managers and BDR leads use it the same way. Cadence and field settings differ, but the structure is the same."},"263":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-thursday-report","content":"Every Thursday, Deal Driver compiles each rep's deal health, activity levels, stuck deals and what to focus on next week. It's in your inbox before your first 1:1 of the day."},"264":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-existing-tools","content":"Visibility tools show you the pipeline. Deal Driver tells you when to look, what to pay attention to and what to do. Many teams run both."},"265":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-meeting-assistant","content":"No. Meeting Assistant is included in Deal Driver, so your reps already have it."},"266":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-crm-writes","content":"No. It sends alerts, briefs and summaries to Slack, email or the Oliv platform. CRM Manager handles field updates."},"267":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/deal-driver#faq-cs-manage