 or hands the work to a specialist agent and reports back. She also monitors your conversations in the background and takes care of things before you ask."},"323":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-44","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                |\n| ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What it does** | Answers questions and gets work done through specialist agents |","table":"table-0"},"324":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-45","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                      |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | AEs, BDRs, SDRs, CSMs and AMs across the revenue org |","table":"table-0"},"325":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-46","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                                              |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **Where you find her** | A side panel on the right of a screen, or the full chat page |","table":"table-0"},"326":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-47","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                         |                                                                                     |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **How freely she acts** | **Ask before acting** (the default) or **Act without asking**, set per conversation |","table":"table-0"},"327":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-48","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                            |                                          |\n| -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| **Where alerts reach you** | Slack, Teams, or within the Oliv product |","table":"table-0"},"328":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-49","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#at-a-glance","content":"|                    |                                                                  |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **What she needs** | A recording or transcript input, a CRM connection and a calendar |","table":"table-0"},"329":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-50","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-it-is","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is one of two super agents in Oliv AI. The other is Oliv AI's Oliver agent. Oliver owns the back end: the process handbook, the configuration and the rules the org runs on. Olivia owns the front end: the relationship, the context and the execution."},"330":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-51","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-it-is","content":"She is the same agent for the whole revenue org, not a separate instance per person. She adapts to each rep's accounts and deals, while Oliver keeps her inside consistent company process. In the agent picker she describes herself in one line: \"I see everything across your team and dispatch the right sub-agent for each task.\""},"331":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-52","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#a-conversation","content":"Olivia doesn't appear in the agent marketplace. She has no card, no detail page, no tools tab and no run history. You reach her through a chat surface, and her background work shows up as rows in the **Agent Feed**."},"332":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-53","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is for revenue people who need the full picture of a deal or account at the moment they act. That picture is split across the CRM, call recordings and email, and someone has to stitch it together."},"333":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-54","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**Prep that's already done.** She surfaces deal context about 30 minutes before a meeting, so you don't rebuild it yourself."},"334":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-55","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**Follow-up drafted for you.** After a call, the follow-up email is drafted and ready within minutes."},"335":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-56","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**Risk raised early.** She flags deals with no activity, close dates nearing without progress, or qualification gaps."},"336":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-57","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#how-it-helps","content":"**One place to ask.** You tell Olivia what you need, and she routes it to the right agent."},"337":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-58","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#without-it","content":"Each piece of busywork is small: prep a meeting, follow up a call, update a field, brief a colleague on a handoff. Added up, it slows the whole team. A quiet deal often gets noticed only when a rep escalates it."},"338":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-59","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#why-buyers-care","content":"Olivia is usually bought by a VP of Sales or a RevOps lead. AE and BDR team leads feel the daily value first. Sales managers care about the team consistency that comes from every rep working inside the same process."},"339":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-60","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"Picture a customer success manager who looks after a book of mid-market accounts. One customer has a renewal call at 4pm, and the CSM last spoke to them six weeks ago. Since then the account has had a support escalation, two calls with an account executive and a run of emails."},"340":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-61","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"A common fix is to open the CRM record, skim old call notes, search the inbox and message the AE for anything missed. That likely takes half an hour per call. Even then, a hint of expansion buried in one of those calls may never reach the CSM."},"341":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-62","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"None of this information is new. It already sits in the calls, the CRM and the inbox. What the CSM lacks is someone who holds that history and assembles it at the right moment, without being asked twice."},"342":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-63","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"Oliv AI puts that assembly in a chat beside the work. The CSM presses the suggestion card for a renewal call at 4pm. Oliv AI's Olivia agent then lists the checks she runs, one line at a time. She can call on Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent for account health and its Gold Digger agent for expansion signals."},"343":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-64","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#approach","content":"The autonomy dropdown under the message box opens on **Ask before acting**, so Olivia aligns on her approach before she takes any action. That setting is one of the points covered in How the Olivia agent compares, below."},"344":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-65","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Open a chat with Olivia. Use the side panel on the right of a screen, or the full chat page, which is reached by link and isn't in the sidebar."},"345":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-66","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Check the agent picker at the top reads **Olivia**. Her surface is blue to violet with a dotted background. Oliver's is amber to orange with a grid."},"346":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-67","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Choose how freely she acts with the dropdown beneath the message box: **Ask before acting** or **Act without asking**."},"347":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-68","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Ask your question. Press one of the three suggestion cards, or type into the box that reads *Ask olivia anything - deals, meeting prep, pipeline, next steps...*."},"348":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-69","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Watch her work. Her row shows *Thinking...* beside her picture, with a card listing each step as she takes it."},"349":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-70","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"Read the answer. It can be plain text or a structured result, such as a list of deals with the company, the owner and a suggested next move."},"350":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-71","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#ask-olivia","content":"If the answer proposes changes, press **Review Changes** to approve them. Accepted changes show as **Merged**."},"351":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-72","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"Olivia's three suggestions are about your own day and deals:"},"352":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-73","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"**What does my day look like?**"},"353":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-74","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"**Get me ready for my [account] renewal call at 4pm today.**"},"354":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-75","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#suggestions","content":"**Where are my deals getting stuck the most?**"},"355":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-76","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#from-the-feed","content":"Hover a row in the **Agent Feed** and press its comment button. A conversation opens about that row, with the row's agent shown as a chip in the message box and the placeholder changed to *Start talking*."},"356":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-77","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"You can describe the work in your own words. For example:"},"357":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-78","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"Draft the follow-up from my call this afternoon.\" Olivia pulls from the meeting transcript and drafts it."},"358":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-79","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"This deal has been stuck for three weeks.\" She engages Oliv AI's Re-Activator agent and surfaces a re-engagement strategy."},"359":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-80","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"Can you prep a mutual action plan for this deal?\" She engages Oliv AI's MAP Manager agent."},"360":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-81","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#things-to-ask","content":"\"I just met six people at an event, line up outreach for each of them.\" She engages Oliv AI's Prospector agent."},"361":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-82","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent works from the data you connect, and each source adds context she can use."},"362":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-83","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Connect a recording or transcript input.** Oliv Notetaker, or an equivalent, is the primary source of her live context."},"363":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-84","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Connect your CRM.** It gives her pipeline and deal history. Oliv AI works as a layer on top of the CRM, alongside your other connected tools."},"364":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-85","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Connect your calendar.** It's how she knows which meetings are coming up."},"365":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-86","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Add email, if you can.** Email is optional, but it adds a lot of context between meetings. LinkedIn or Sales Navigator is optional too, for contact enrichment."},"366":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-87","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#set-up","content":"**Let Oliver set the playbook.** RevOps and leadership configure Oliver with your stages, ownership and handoffs, and Olivia operates inside those rules from day one."},"367":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-88","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-oliver","content":"Oliv AI's Oliver agent sets the process and Olivia runs within it. When Oliver updates the company's methodology or approval process, her behavior updates to match. The Process Graph is the living playbook every Oliv agent reads before it acts."},"368":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-89","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-meeting-agents","content":"Before a meeting, Olivia coordinates with Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent for active opportunities and with Oliv AI's Researcher agent for new contacts."},"369":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-90","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-crm-manager","content":"After every call, she surfaces proposed CRM updates, such as field values, stage changes and next steps, for the rep to review and approve. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent handles the execution of those writes."},"370":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-91","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-cs-agents","content":"Olivia alerts the team when Oliv AI's Gold Digger agent detects an expansion signal. For CS managers she works with Gold Digger and Oliv AI's Portfolio Manager agent."},"371":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-92","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-deal-driver","content":"She also alerts reps when Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent flags a manager-level concern on one of their deals."},"372":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-93","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#with-context","content":"Every agent draws on the same foundation. Context Capture maps raw activity into account, deal, people and process context, so Olivia knows what changed and what needs attention."},"373":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-94","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#account-executives","content":"An AE walks into every call prepared, because Oliv AI's Olivia agent handles the brief. When the call ends, she updates the CRM and drafts the follow-up, and at-risk deals surface before they become a problem. More on AI agents for sales teams."},"374":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-95","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#sales-development","content":"A BDR back from an event gets every contact enriched, matched and sequenced before the signal cools. High-intent inbound is qualified and routed in under 30 minutes. See how Oliv AI supports sales development teams."},"375":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-96","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#account-managers","content":"An account manager gets the full account history before every call. Olivia surfaces the revival window before an account goes dark, and expansion signals from calls nobody would review by hand."},"376":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-97","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#cs-managers","content":"Expansion signals from customer calls reach sales the same day, without anyone asking. At-risk accounts surface before the renewal window closes, and every call updates portfolio health. More on Oliv AI for customer success teams."},"377":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-98","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"Many revenue tools now answer plain-language questions about deals. Oliv AI's Olivia agent also hands the work to specialist agents, raises deal risk on her own, and lets you choose per conversation whether she asks before she acts. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all four."},"378":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-99","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"Revenue assistant features, from each platform's public documentation:"},"379":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-100","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform    | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                            | Yes                              | Yes                            | Yes                                        |","table":"table-1"},"380":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-101","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents         | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Gong** | Yes (Gong Assistant)                           | Partly (runs your saved personal agents) | Yes (AI Deal Monitor warnings) | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"381":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-102","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform  | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Avoma** | Yes (Global Ask Avoma)                         | Not in docs                      | Yes (Deal Health Score)        | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"382":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-103","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform      | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Global AskFred)                           | Not in docs                      | Yes (Deal Intelligence)        | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"383":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-104","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform   | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ---------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Fathom** | Yes (Account-Wide Ask Fathom)                  | Not in docs                      | Partly (answers on deal risks) | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"384":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-105","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"| Platform     | Plain-language questions on deals and pipeline | Hands tasks to specialist agents | Deal risk raised automatically | Ask-before-acting setting per conversation |\n| ------------ | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Omni)                                     | Not in docs                      | Yes (Deal Health)              | Not in docs                                |","table":"table-1"},"385":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-106","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"386":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-107","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"**Work handed off, not just answered.** Olivia dispatches the right specialist agent for each task and reports back. Gong's help centre describes agents as personal assets that each team member creates for their own use. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"387":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-108","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"**Answers that lead to action.** Olivia drafts the follow-up and surfaces CRM updates for review after a call. Avoma describes Global Ask Avoma as an assistant for asking questions about your organization's data. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"388":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-109","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"**You set how far she goes.** Olivia opens each conversation on **Ask before acting**, and you can switch to **Act without asking**. Gong documents that its agents don't perform actions in external systems. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"389":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-110","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"390":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-111","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**Not in the marketplace.** Browsing agents won't find Olivia. Reach her through the side panel, the chat page or an **Agent Feed** row."},"391":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-112","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**Conversations aren't saved.** A conversation can't be named, reopened or searched, and leaving the screen loses it."},"392":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-113","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**English only.** Olivia works in English."},"393":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-114","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**No warning on Act without asking.** Oliver shows a **High Risk** banner for this setting and Olivia doesn't, so check the dropdown before you leave a conversation."},"394":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-115","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**No dispatch log.** You see which agent did a piece of work through its \"Drafted by\" line, not through a list of hand-offs."},"395":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-116","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#limits","content":"**She doesn't own process.** Stages, ownership and handoffs are set through Oliver."},"396":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-117","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-who","content":"Oliv AI's Olivia agent is the agent you talk to rather than configure. She introduces herself as your chief of AI staff and works through Oliv AI's specialist agents."},"397":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-118","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-same-for-everyone","content":"Yes. She's one agent for the whole revenue org. She adapts to each rep's accounts and deals, and Oliver keeps her within company process."},"398":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-119","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-vs-oliver","content":"Oliver is the back-end super agent that RevOps and leadership configure. Olivia is the front-facing one the revenue team works with. Oliver sets the rules and Olivia runs the plays."},"399":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-120","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-vs-individual-agents","content":"Individual agents are specialists, but they don't know your full situation. Olivia does, so she picks the right agent, gives it the context and brings back the result."},"400":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-121","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-slack","content":"Yes. She surfaces alerts and drives execution through Slack, Teams, or within the Oliv product."},"401":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-122","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-autonomy","content":"Yes. The dropdown beneath the message box offers **Ask before acting** and **Act without asking**. It opens on **Ask before acting** in each conversation."},"402":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-123","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-monitoring","content":"Her introduction says she monitors your conversations in the background and proactively takes care of things for you."},"403":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-124","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-see-work","content":"Her work shows up as rows in the **Agent Feed**. Work she delegated carries a \"Drafted by\" line naming the agent that produced it."},"404":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-125","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-saved","content":"No. Leaving the screen loses the conversation."},"405":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-126","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-needs","content":"A recording or transcript input such as Oliv Notetaker, a CRM connection and a calendar. Email and LinkedIn or Sales Navigator are optional."},"406":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-127","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#faq-sold-separately","content":"No. She's the front-facing interface through which the Oliv platform is experienced. For plans, see Oliv AI pricing."},"407":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-128","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"Olivia, Chief of AI Staff: the Olivia agent's page on oliv.ai."},"408":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-129","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"The Oliver agent: the super agent that sets the rules Olivia works within."},"409":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-130","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"AI agents vs AI copilots: why an agent that acts differs from one that only answers."},"410":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-131","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"How agentic sales automation works: the multi-agent model Olivia orchestrates."},"411":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-132","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"RevOps and Oliv AI: how revenue operations sets up the process Olivia follows."},"412":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-133","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"The Deal Driver agent docs: the manager's view of the same pipeline."},"413":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-134","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"Run deals as an account executive: how an AE uses Olivia alongside the other agents."},"414":{"id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia-135","page_id":"/product-docs/agents/olivia","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/agents/olivia#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"415":{"id":"/product-docs","page_id":"/product-docs","type":"page","content":"Oliv AI product documentation","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs"},"416":{"id":"/product-docs-0","page_id":"/product-docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs","content":"How Oliv AI works, page by page."},"417":{"id":"/product-docs-1","page_id":"/product-docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs#agents","content":"Agents"},"418":{"id":"/product-docs-2","page_id":"/product-docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs#agent-builder","content":"Agent builder"},"419":{"id":"/product-docs-3","page_id":"/product-docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs#workflows","content":"Workflows"},"420":{"id":"/product-docs-4","page_id":"/product-docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs#use-cases","content":"Use cases"},"421":{"id":"/product-docs-5","page_id":"/product-docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs","content":"Oliv AI's product documentation explains what each Oliv AI agent does, how to set it up, and how it compares with other revenue tools. Oliv AI builds AI agents for revenue teams that work as a layer on top of your CRM."},"422":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"page","content":"Run deals as an account executive","breadcrumbs":["Oliv AI docs","Use cases"],"tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals"},"423":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-0","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","content":"How an account executive uses Oliv AI's agents to prepare for deal meetings, follow up after calls, keep the CRM current and catch stalled deals, and how that compares with other deal tools."},"424":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-1","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"At a glance"},"425":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-2","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#where-it-fits","content":"Where Oliv AI fits for account executives"},"426":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-3","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#what-its-for","content":"What it's for"},"427":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-4","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"How it helps"},"428":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-5","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#without-it","content":"What happens without it"},"429":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-6","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#why-buyers-care","content":"Why they care"},"430":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-7","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"The Oliv AI approach to running deals"},"431":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-8","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"Before a meeting"},"432":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-9","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"After a call"},"433":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-10","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#review-updates","content":"Review the proposed CRM updates"},"434":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-11","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"Keep the CRM current without typing"},"435":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-12","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"When a deal goes quiet"},"436":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-13","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"How Oliv AI compares for account executives"},"437":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-14","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"Why Oliv AI is the stronger choice for account executives"},"438":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-15","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"Limits and things to know"},"439":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-16","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#common-questions","content":"Common questions"},"440":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-17","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-timing","content":"When does the pre-meeting brief arrive?"},"441":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-18","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-length","content":"How long is the brief?"},"442":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-19","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-methodologies","content":"Which sales methodologies does it support?"},"443":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-20","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-follow-up-template","content":"Is the follow-up email a template?"},"444":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-21","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-review-updates","content":"Do CRM updates go in without me seeing them?"},"445":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-22","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-incomplete-crm","content":"What if our CRM data is incomplete?"},"446":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-23","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-new-contacts","content":"Does it create contacts I haven't added?"},"447":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-24","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-unrecorded","content":"What happens if a meeting wasn't recorded?"},"448":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-25","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-reminders","content":"Will I get reminders about my deals?"},"449":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-26","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-setup","content":"How long does setup take?"},"450":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-27","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Related"},"451":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-28","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","content":"Oliv AI gives an account executive a set of agents that handle the work around each deal: the prep before a meeting, the follow-up after it and the CRM upkeep in between. You walk into calls prepared, review drafted emails and proposed field updates instead of writing them, and get a nudge when a deal starts to stall. This page shows how those pieces fit together across a deal."},"452":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-29","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                 |\n| ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| **Who it's for** | Account executives working active opportunities |","table":"table-0"},"453":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-30","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                      |                                                                        |\n| -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Before a meeting** | A brief about 30 minutes before every meeting on an active opportunity |","table":"table-0"},"454":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-31","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                  |                                                                                   |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **After a call** | A drafted follow-up email, proposed CRM field updates and qualification gap flags |","table":"table-0"},"455":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-32","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                |                                                                               |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **In the CRM** | Accounts, contacts, activities and tasks kept current from your conversations |","table":"table-0"},"456":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-33","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                        |                                                     |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **When a deal stalls** | Nudges when next steps go overdue or activity drops |","table":"table-0"},"457":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-34","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#at-a-glance","content":"|                     |                                                     |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Agents involved** | Meeting Assistant, CRM Manager, Deal Driver, Olivia |","table":"table-0"},"458":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-35","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#what-its-for","content":"Oliv AI takes the admin around each deal off the account executive. The time between calls goes to selling, not to rebuilding context or typing notes into the CRM."},"459":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-36","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Briefed before you join.** A one-screen brief lands about 30 minutes before each deal meeting."},"460":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-37","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Follow-up written from the call.** The email draft comes from the actual transcript, not a template."},"461":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-38","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Fields proposed, not typed.** You accept, edit or reject each suggested CRM update."},"462":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-39","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#how-it-helps","content":"**Stalls flagged early.** You get a nudge when next steps go overdue or activity drops."},"463":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-40","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#without-it","content":"Each call can cost 15 to 20 minutes of digging for context beforehand and about 15 minutes of email writing afterward. CRM updates depend on what the rep remembers. Qualification gaps then surface at the forecast review, when it's too late to act on them."},"464":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-41","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#why-buyers-care","content":"The account executive is the champion, because the time savings show up before and after every call. VPs of Sales and sales managers usually make the purchase. It matters most for reps with a full calendar of meetings on open deals."},"465":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-42","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"Imagine an account executive with four customer calls on a Tuesday, booked almost back to back. Two are with deals in late-stage evaluation. One is a first call with a new stakeholder, and one is a pricing follow-up."},"466":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-43","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"The usual routine is to skim old notes in the few minutes between calls. Each follow-up then gets written from memory at the end of the day, and CRM fields wait until Friday. By then some details have probably faded, so the record shows less than the calls did. The next meeting on each deal may start from a thinner picture as a result."},"467":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-44","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"Everything the rep needs is already on record: the recordings, the CRM history and the email thread. The real gap is timing. Prep is most useful in the half hour before a call. The follow-up is easiest to write while the conversation is still fresh in everyone's mind."},"468":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-45","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"Oliv AI moves that work to the right moment. Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a brief before each meeting on an active deal and drafts the follow-up after it. Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent turns what was said into field updates for the rep to approve."},"469":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-46","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#approach","content":"The brief is built to fit on one screen and take about 60 seconds to read, as described under Before a meeting. How this setup lines up against other deal tools is covered in How Oliv AI compares for account executives, below."},"470":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-47","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"Oliv AI's Meeting Assistant agent sends a brief about 30 minutes before every meeting linked to an active opportunity. If the deal exists and the meeting is on your calendar, it runs automatically. The brief covers:"},"471":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-48","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Deal summary.** Stage, amount, close date, last activity and next steps."},"472":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-49","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Qualification status.** Where the deal stands against your methodology, with gaps and open questions highlighted. MEDDPICC, BANT, SPICED, MEDPICS and custom frameworks are supported."},"473":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-50","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Stakeholders.** Who is in the meeting, what roles they play and what they care about, based on prior conversations."},"474":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-51","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"**Recommended agenda.** Tailored to the deal stage and the qualification gaps."},"475":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-52","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#before-a-meeting","content":"For a first meeting with a new contact, Oliv AI's Researcher agent builds the brief instead. Oliv AI's Olivia agent also surfaces the right context before every meeting, such as deal status, stakeholder intel, qualification gaps and what was agreed last time. Read more on getting the most from an AI meeting assistant."},"476":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-53","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"Once the meeting recording is processed, Meeting Assistant prepares three things:"},"477":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-54","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"**A follow-up email draft.** It covers what was discussed, what was agreed and the next steps, with dates where possible. You review, adjust and send. See how a strong sales follow-up converts."},"478":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-55","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"**Proposed deal field updates.** Stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps, based on what was said."},"479":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-56","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#after-a-call","content":"**Qualification gap flags.** New information, or notable absences, that change the deal's qualification status."},"480":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-57","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#review-updates","content":"After every activity, you get a Slack or preferred-channel message that says it found updates for a number of fields. The **Agent Updates** tab shows each field, its current CRM value, the proposed value and the moment in the conversation behind it. Choose **Accept**, **Edit and accept** or **Reject**."},"481":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-58","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#review-updates","content":"A full history of how each field was updated stays visible. Once accuracy thresholds are met, RevOps can confirm the switch to auto mode."},"482":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-59","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"Oliv AI's CRM Manager agent keeps accounts, contacts, opportunities, activities and tasks current from your conversations."},"483":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-60","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**New people and companies.** When a meeting, call or email involves a company or person not yet in the CRM, it creates the record and enriches it."},"484":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-61","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**The right deal.** It maps each activity to the right account and opportunity, including multi-threaded deals. If it can't resolve one, it asks you."},"485":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-62","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**Tasks from next steps.** It creates tasks from the next steps in meetings, calls and emails, and assigns them to the right owner."},"486":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-63","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**Buying committee roles.** It tracks each contact's role on the opportunity, such as economic buyer, champion or blocker."},"487":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-64","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"**Meetings that weren't recorded.** It can prompt you for a quick voice summary and use that as a data source."},"488":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-65","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#crm-current","content":"It works with Salesforce, HubSpot and Zoho, as a layer on top of the CRM you already use. More on how Oliv AI handles CRM automation."},"489":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-66","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"Oliv AI's Deal Driver agent nudges you directly when a deal stalls, a next step goes overdue or activity drops. That catches the gap before your manager needs to step in. CRM Manager also sends end-of-day reminders for open CRM tasks or unverified deal updates."},"490":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-67","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#deal-stalls","content":"To work a stuck deal, tell Oliv AI's Olivia agent something like \"This deal has been stuck for three weeks.\" She engages Oliv AI's Re-Activator agent and surfaces a re-engagement strategy, as covered in the things you can hand Olivia. For how deals slip in the first place, read why deal views miss half the picture."},"491":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-68","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"Several deal tools now prepare reps for meetings. Oliv AI also proposes the CRM updates from each call for you to review, and nudges you directly when a next step goes overdue. Oliv AI is the only platform in this table that does all three."},"492":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-69","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"Deal workflow features for account executives, from each platform's public documentation:"},"493":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-70","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform    | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Oliv AI** | Yes                                 | Yes                                             | Yes                                   |","table":"table-1"},"494":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-71","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Gong** | Yes (AI meeting prep)               | Partly (one text field on deal boards)          | Partly (overdue to-dos list)          |","table":"table-1"},"495":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-72","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform     | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Outreach** | Yes (Meeting Prep Agent)            | Yes (Deal Agent)                                | Partly (overdue tasks in reports)     |","table":"table-1"},"496":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-73","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform      | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Fireflies** | Yes (Meeting Prep briefs)           | Yes (Autofill CRM)                              | Not in docs                           |","table":"table-1"},"497":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-74","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform  | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Avoma** | Partly (meeting prep templates)     | Automated field updates                         | Not in docs                           |","table":"table-1"},"498":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-75","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"| Platform   | Pre-meeting brief for deal meetings | CRM updates proposed for review after each call | Rep nudges when next steps go overdue |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| **Fathom** | Not in docs                         | Writes summaries and tasks to CRM               | Not in docs                           |","table":"table-1"},"499":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-76","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare","content":"*Yes: documented and built in. Partly: documented with a limit, shown in brackets. Not in docs: not found in the vendor's public documentation.*"},"500":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-77","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"**Every core deal field, proposed after each call.** Oliv AI proposes stage, amount, close date, qualification fields and next steps from the conversation. Gong's deal boards fill one text-only CRM field with AI-suggested updates. Compare Oliv AI vs Gong."},"501":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-78","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"**A brief built around the deal.** Oliv AI's brief shows qualification status against your methodology and a recommended agenda. Avoma documents templates that standardize meeting prep by meeting purpose. Compare Oliv AI vs Avoma."},"502":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-79","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"**A nudge, not a list to check.** Oliv AI nudges the rep directly when next steps go overdue. Gong's to-do filter lets you show to-dos that are due or overdue. See Oliv AI as a Gong alternative."},"503":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-80","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#compare-stronger","content":"*Competitor details checked against each vendor's public documentation on 21 October 2026. Features and plans change, so confirm with the vendor before you decide.*"},"504":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-81","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**Active opportunities only.** Meeting Assistant works on meetings linked to an active opportunity. Researcher covers first-time contacts."},"505":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-82","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**It needs a recording.** Meeting Assistant relies on Oliv Notetaker recordings and transcripts and a Deal Insights subscription."},"506":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-83","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**Not a CRM.** CRM Manager works on top of Salesforce, HubSpot or Zoho. It doesn't replace them."},"507":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-84","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**Pending updates have a deadline.** If a rep doesn't complete updates within a defined window, deals can be deferred or flagged as closed-lost. Each org configures this."},"508":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-85","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#limits","content":"**Auto mode comes later.** Updates stay in review until RevOps confirms the switch to auto mode."},"509":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-86","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-timing","content":"About 30 minutes before every meeting linked to an active opportunity in your CRM."},"510":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-87","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-brief-length","content":"One screen, about 60 seconds to read. It covers the deal summary, qualification status, stakeholder context and a recommended agenda."},"511":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-88","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-methodologies","content":"MEDDPICC, BANT, SPICED, MEDPICS, or your company's custom qualification framework."},"512":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-89","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-follow-up-template","content":"No. Meeting Assistant reads the transcript and drafts from the actual conversation. You review, adjust and send."},"513":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-90","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-review-updates","content":"Not at first. You accept, edit or reject each one in **Agent Updates**. RevOps can switch to auto mode once accuracy thresholds are met."},"514":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-91","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-incomplete-crm","content":"CRM Manager fills in missing or stale data from call history as it goes, so you don't need a clean CRM to start."},"515":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-92","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-new-contacts","content":"Yes. When an activity involves a person or company not yet in the CRM, CRM Manager creates and enriches the record."},"516":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-93","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-unrecorded","content":"CRM Manager can prompt you for a quick voice summary and use that as the data source."},"517":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-94","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-reminders","content":"Yes. Deal Driver nudges you when deals stall, next steps go overdue or activity drops. CRM Manager sends end-of-day reminders for open CRM tasks."},"518":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-95","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#faq-setup","content":"Connect your calendar, your call recording tool or Oliv's native recorder, and your CRM. Most teams are connected within a week."},"519":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-96","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"The Olivia agent: the agent you ask for prep, follow-ups and next steps."},"520":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-97","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"The Deal Driver agent: what your manager sees from the same deals."},"521":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-98","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"AI agents for sales teams: how Oliv AI supports the whole sales org."},"522":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-99","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Deal tracking software: use cases and what to weigh."},"523":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-100","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"AI for sales productivity: where reps save time with AI tools."},"524":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-101","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Oliv AI integrations: the CRM, calendar and recording tools Oliv AI connects to."},"525":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-102","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Oliv AI pricing: plans and what each includes."},"526":{"id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals-103","page_id":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/product-docs/use-cases/ae-run-deals#related","content":"Oliv AI product documentation: every documented agent and feature."},"527":{"id":"/product-docs/workflo